                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.9111/558: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Merriam</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-05-21T17:00:00+03:25">May 21, 1936—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received May 21—1:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>36. Department’s telegram 26, May 20, 2 p.m. Personal letter delivered to Foreign
                    Minister this afternoon as drafted with translation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merriam</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
